// The DHIS2 aggregate wire shape as a FHIR logical model. It is a description of what
// `/api/dataValueSets` accepts, not a resource anybody stores: it exists so a StructureMap has a
// target to name, and so the conversion contract is machine-readable rather than prose.
Logical: {{ names.data_value_set_model }}
Id: {{ names.data_value_set_model_id }}
Title: {{ model.title_literal }}
Description: {{ model.description_literal }}
* ^status = #{{ ig_status }}
* ^experimental = {{ "true" if experimental else "false" }}
{% for element in elements %}
* {{ element.path }} {{ element.cardinality }} {{ element.element_type }} {{ element.short_literal }} {{ element.definition_literal }}
{% endfor %}
